# SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE™

The system operates through three independent layers:

---

# LAYER 1 — ENGINE LOGIC LAYER™
(Static Intelligence)

Contains:
- engine philosophy,
- operational rules,
- evaluation systems,
- strategic constraints,
- behavioral logic,
- output contracts™.

This layer remains reusable across:
- all books,
- all niches,
- all series,
- all authors™.

NO book-specific data allowed here.

---

# LAYER 2 — PROJECT RUNTIME LAYER™
(Dynamic Intelligence)

Contains:
- current book data,
- target audience,
- positioning,
- transformation promise,
- market category,
- series context,
- emotional targeting™.

This layer changes per project.

---

# LAYER 3 — EXECUTION STATE LAYER™
(Runtime State Intelligence)

Contains:
- current active engine,
- previous outputs,
- revision history,
- failure detection,
- quality scores,
- strategic confidence levels,
- execution stability™.

This layer changes continuously during execution.

