The controller dynamically assembles context from:

- current runtime state,
- project memory,
- reader psychology,
- series continuity,
- previous outputs,
- market intelligence,
- engine requirements™.

Context injection MUST remain:
- compressed,
- relevant,
- high-signal,
- strategically aligned™.

---

# COGNITIVE COMPRESSION LAYER™

The system must:
- preserve strategic continuity,
- minimize token waste,
- compress low-priority information,
- prioritize critical intelligence™.

The system MUST avoid:
- context flooding,
- duplicated instructions,
- recursive prompt bloat,
- irrelevant memory injection™.

