The system maintains persistent memory for:

- series identity,
- positioning history,
- reader psychology patterns,
- approved outputs,
- rejected outputs,
- revision cycles,
- market intelligence,
- performance learnings™.

Memory continuity must survive across:
- books,
- sequels,
- spin-offs,
- future publishing runs™.

